2026-09-29 10:51:42,663 INFO sqlalchemy.engine.Engine [cached since 87.62s ago] ('30e956bb-d5e5-4241-acc2-8b850cc8034e', '970de595-e0df-4b6a-a2fb-28401462c6d8', '27573c9d-0136-4923-a553-981455c867b2', '2c605d7d-c25e-46f5-b4c9-0f77d3b4a61a', None, 4, '2026-10-02', 0, 10, 1, 4, '2026-10-02', 1, '', 'Basic 7', 'ICT', 11, 60, 'Achimota Basic School', 'Persistence Teacher', 'Introduction to Computing', 'Components of Computers and Computer Systems', 'B7.1.1.2', 'B7.1.1.2', '["B7.1.1.2.1"]', '["B7.1.1.2.1"]', 'Windows desktop: Start screen, tiles and taskbar', 'Previous lesson: Components of Computers and Computer Systems', '[{"id": "fd828795-2baf-4836-aaf8-f83769791633", "description": "Learners can demonstrate Windows desktop: Start screen, tiles and taskbar", "indicator_code": "B7.1.1.2.1", "source": "deterministic"}]', '', '', '[]', '', '', '[]', '["Bootable Flash drive"]', '[]', '["Bootable Flash drive"]', "This lesson builds on 'Components of Computers and Computer Systems' and moves the class on to Windows desktop: Start screen, tiles and taskbar.", "Build on the previous lesson ('Components of Computers and Computer Systems'). Ask learners what they see when a Windows computer finishes starting. Record the parts they name on the board and add any missing ones.", '[{"id": "bd68f5b2-9b33-43f1-8c15-700ba88d16ad", "phase": "TEACHING AND DEMONSTRATION", "description": "At the computer (or using a screenshot on the  ... (759 characters truncated) ...  the board or an unplugged model if there are not enough devices for everyone.", "duration_minutes": 12, "resources": [], "source": "deterministic"}]', '[{"id": "478e3ca3-b4a7-4a77-bfdb-f20da5fcabfd", "phase": "LEARNER", "description": "Watch and listen carefully, then describe each step of Windows de ... (540 characters truncated) ... ch step of Windows desktop: Start screen, tiles and taskbar in your own words.", "duration_minutes": 12, "resources": [], "source": "deterministic"}]', '[{"id": "b8c97981-2da7-4e24-9291-53ce3797b881", "phase": "TEACHER", "description": "Model Windows desktop: Start screen, tiles and taskbar slowly, th ... (545 characters truncated) ... and taskbar slowly, think aloud, and check that all learners can see and hear.", "duration_minutes": 12, "resources": [], "source": "deterministic"}]', 'Point to a screen part and ask a learner to name it and say what it does; require all four feature names across the class. Ask a pair to demonstrate previewing a window from the taskbar. Assessment mode: Oral questions and observation of participation.', "Review the steps for Windows desktop: Start screen, tiles and taskbar, discuss the common problem met and how it was solved, and link to everyday technology. Preview the next lesson ('Health and Safety in using ICT tools').", '[]', '[]', '[]', 'Draw the Windows desktop from memory and label the Start screen, tiles and the taskbar. Write one sentence on what a preview thumbnail shows.', 'Pairs use the computer (or the labelled screenshot) to open two windows, preview one from the taskbar, and record the four desktop features with what each one does. The teacher observes and asks each pair to demonstrate one feature.', 'Draw the Windows desktop from memory and label the Start screen, tiles and the taskbar. Write one sentence on what a preview thumbnail shows.', "Support: Pair learners who need help with a peer 'digital buddy' and provide a numbered step card for Windows desktop: Start screen, tiles and taskba ... (78 characters truncated) ... op: Start screen, tiles and taskbar to a slightly harder task.\nGrouping: Whole-class demonstration, small groups at shared devices, individual task.", '[]', 'tpl-wapef-approved-plan', '', '', 'generated', 0, 0, '{}', '2026-09-29 10:51:42.662919', '2026-09-29 10:51:42.662922')
