ndows desktop: Start screen, tiles and taskbar slowly, th ... (545 characters truncated) ... and taskbar slowly, think aloud, and check that all learners can see and hear.", "duration_minutes": 12, "resources": [], "source": "deterministic"}]', 'Point to a screen part and ask a learner to name it and say what it does; require all four feature names across the class. Ask a pair to demonstrate previewing a window from the taskbar. Assessment mode: Oral questions and observation of participation.', "Review the steps for Windows desktop: Start screen, tiles and taskbar, discuss the common problem met and how it was solved, and link to everyday technology. Preview the next lesson ('Health and Safety in using ICT tools').", '[]', '[]', '[]', 'Draw the Windows desktop from memory and label the Start screen, tiles and the taskbar. Write one sentence on what a preview thumbnail shows.', 'Pairs use the computer (or the labelled screenshot) to open two windows, preview one from the taskbar, and record the four desktop features with what each one does. The teacher observes and asks each pair to demonstrate one feature.', 'Draw the Windows desktop from memory and label the Start screen, tiles and the taskbar. Write one sentence on what a preview thumbnail shows.', "Support: Pair learners who need help with a peer 'digital buddy' and provide a numbered step card for Windows desktop: Start screen, tiles and taskba ... (78 characters truncated) ... op: Start screen, tiles and taskbar to a slightly harder task.\nGrouping: Whole-class demonstration, small groups at shared devices, individual task.", '[]', 'tpl-wapef-approved-plan', '', '', 'generated', 0, 0, '{}', '2026-09-29 10:51:42.662919', '2026-09-29 10:51:42.662922')
