2026-09-29 10:51:42,669 INFO sqlalchemy.engine.Engine [cached since 87.63s ago] ('099da1e7-118a-4fc6-b132-86154fb41449', '970de595-e0df-4b6a-a2fb-28401462c6d8', '27573c9d-0136-4923-a553-981455c867b2', '2c605d7d-c25e-46f5-b4c9-0f77d3b4a61a', None, 6, '2026-10-16', 0, 10, 1, 5, '2026-10-16', 2, '', 'Basic 7', 'ICT', 11, 60, 'Achimota Basic School', 'Persistence Teacher', 'Introduction to Computing', 'Health and Safety in using ICT tools', 'B7.1.2.1', 'B7.1.2.1', '["B7.1.2.1.1"]', '["B7.1.2.1.1"]', 'Introduction to Computing - Health and Safety in using ICT tools', 'Previous lesson: Components of Computers and Computer Systems', '[{"id": "eb61adcd-0251-4655-ae20-b63db4a39be4", "description": "Learners can explore and talk about Health and Safety in using ICT tools", "indicator_code": "B7.1.2.1.1", "source": "deterministic"}]', '', '', '[]', '', '', '[]', '["Smart Phone", "Pictures"]', '[]', '["Smart Phone", "Pictures"]', "This lesson builds on 'Components of Computers and Computer Systems' and moves the class on to Health and Safety in using ICT tools.", "Build on the previous lesson ('Components of Computers and Computer Systems'). Recall the last ICT skill learned and connect it to Health and Safety in using ICT tools. If devices are limited, use an unplugged analogy from everyday life.", '[{"id": "d6ddea3d-7815-4b27-9bf2-0088f23c4cee", "phase": "DEMONSTRATION / EXPLANATION", "description": "Demonstrate the concept or steps for Health a ... (642 characters truncated) ... nd Safety in using ICT tools on their own and troubleshoot one common problem.", "duration_minutes": 10, "resources": [], "source": "deterministic"}]', '[{"id": "e32715cc-a742-4ed9-ac56-f0705bf2a7f1", "phase": "LEARNER", "description": "Watch and listen carefully, then describe each step of Health and ... (495 characters truncated) ... d Safety in using ICT tools on your own and check your work before you finish.", "duration_minutes": 10, "resources": [], "source": "deterministic"}]', '[{"id": "40b522ce-318b-492e-8950-ebe6cf6c3f10", "phase": "TEACHER", "description": "Model Health and Safety in using ICT tools slowly, think aloud, a ... (520 characters truncated) ... nd note learners who need re-teaching of Health and Safety in using ICT tools.", "duration_minutes": 10, "resources": [], "source": "deterministic"}]', 'Observe learners performing Health and Safety in using ICT tools against a steps checklist, or mark a paper-based version where devices are not available. Assessment mode: Oral questions and observation of participation.', 'Review the steps for Health and Safety in using ICT tools, discuss the common problem met and how it was solved, and link to everyday technology.', '[]', '[]', '[]', 'Practise the steps for Health and Safety in using ICT tools at home and be ready to show one step in the next lesson.', 'In groups, learners demonstrate the task for Health and Safety in using ICT tools while the teacher observes and records which learners have met the indicator.', 'Practise the steps for Health and Safety in using ICT tools at home and be ready to show one step in the next lesson.', "Support: Pair learners who need help with a peer 'digital buddy' and provide a numbered step card for Health and Safety in using ICT tools.\nExtensio ... (54 characters truncated) ... ealth and Safety in using ICT tools to a slightly harder task.\nGrouping: Whole-class demonstration, small groups at shared devices, individual task.", '[]', 'tpl-wapef-approved-plan', '', '', 'generated', 0, 0, '{}', '2026-09-29 10:51:42.669017', '2026-09-29 10:51:42.669019')
